(7660150, 1247843, 29949, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by Kroburg:</b></div><hr/><i> Yes was a great day out! But technically Scotland is part of the UK, isn''t it? ;-)<br/>Congrats on the top 10 finish!<br/> <br/>And BTW, it''s the same picture I used for my travel guide :-)<br/> <br/><a href="https://www.dpchallenge.com/image.php?IMAGE_ID=1248310" rel="nofollow" target="_blank"><img alt="'' . substr(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/145000-149999/147314/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_1248310.jpg'', strrpos(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/145000-149999/147314/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_1248310.jpg'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/145000-149999/147314/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_1248310.jpg"/></a> </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>Well UK it is but if you try asking a Scotsman if Scotland is part of England ... :) <br/> <br/>Without your guide, I would never ever done the special journey to get the one of the beautiful scene ever. <br/>Thank you Kees. <br/> <br/>BTW You shot is better than mine ... only a touch thought ;) x</td>', 'Originally posted by Kroburg: Yes was a great day out! But technically Scotland is part of the UK, isn''t it? ;-)Congrats on the top 10 finish! And BTW, it''s the same picture I used for my travel guide :-)    Well UK it is but if you try asking a Scotsman if Scotland is part of England ... :)  Without your guide, I would never ever done the special journey to get the one of the beautiful scene ever. Thank you Kees.  BTW You shot is better than mine ... only a touch thought ;) x', '2020-04-26 15:21:12.000000', NULL, 0),
